              <span>RECRUITER OS</span>
              <b>V18.2</b>
            </div>
            <h1>
              Turn a stack of resumes into a <em>clear hiring workspace.</em>
            </h1>
            <p>
              Screen, investigate and organize candidates with an explainable ATS workflow,
              job-scoped analysis, Candidate 360 and resume version history.
            </p>

            <div className="launch-v181-actions">
              <button className="launch-v181-primary" onClick={onGetStarted}>
                Launch workspace <span>↗</span>
              </button>
              <button className="launch-v181-secondary" onClick={onSignIn}>
                Sign in to existing workspace
